      "raw": "<p>Ohhh yes, Unity <em>loves</em> anyone who lets her do stuff out of turn :D. I&#39;ve mentioend it before, but an epic hero-combo we got out once was TLT, Adept, and Unity (in that order). So TLT let everyone draw loads of stuff, then I (as the Adept) managed to get out Inventive Preparation and an appropriate instrument to play its Accompany on my first or second turn and started using it on Unity at every chance I got, which meant Unity, in turn, basically ended up drawing a whole load of bots and then getting them into play and proceeded to totally wreck whomever it was we were up against in a fairly short amount of time :D.</p>",
